    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used a simple AI tool last year to check my algebra homework. It showed step-by-step solutions, which helped me understand where I went wrong. I found it useful for reinforcing concepts, especially when I was stuck. It didn’t replace my learning, but it made me feel more confident. I still prefer working through problems myself, though.",
